{"id":"n5775411f98","headline":"AI boom to fuel Australia inflation despite higher rates, ex-RBA official says - AOL","summary":"Australia's AI investment boom is likely to boost inflation in the near term as productivity benefits take longer to emerge. The former Reserve Bank of Australia official said this leaves the central bank with limited room.","why":"The Reserve Bank of Australia sets the country's cash rate, which drives borrowing costs across the economy and the value of the Australian dollar. Inflation trends shape its rate decisions.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Sydney","country":"Australia","lat":-33.87,"lon":151.21,"region":"oc"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"AOL.com","url":"https://www.aol.com/articles/ai-boom-fuel-australia-inflation-112715000.html"},"sources":[{"name":"AOL.com","url":"https://www.aol.com/articles/ai-boom-fuel-australia-inflation-112715000.html"}],"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:27:15Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"bddd650e721b34a9","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-08T11:27:15Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-08T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/data-center-servers-2588137.jpg","alt":"data center servers (illustration)","credit":"StockSnap","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/glass-reflection-lights-door-stock-2588137/"}}